[Event "Knight School"]
[Opening "Englund Gambit"]
[Variation "Qd2 Qxb2 Fork"]
[ECO "A40"]
[Character "tactical,gambit"]
[Risk "high"]
[EarlyMate "none"]
[Tricks "trap,fork"]
[Refutes "1. d4 e5 2. dxe5 Nc6 3. Nf3 Qe7 4. Bf4 Qb4+ 5. Qd2"]

1. d4 e5 2. dxe5 Nc6 3. Nf3 Qe7 4. Bf4 Qb4+ 5. Qd2? { Blocks the check with the queen, but this leaves the b2 pawn and the rook on a1 undefended. } 5... Qxb2 { Takes the pawn and forks the rook on a1 and the knight on b1. [%cal Gb2a1,Gb2b1] }
6. c3 6... Qxa1 { Takes the rook, and White cannot easily trap the queen. } 7. Qc2 7... d6 { Opens the bishop and attacks the pawn on e5, while the queen on a1 is safe for the moment. } 8. Nd2 8... Be6 *
